# Two samples, then reads fired by `Tick` with no new assertion. After t=60
# the closed interval [0,60) holds v=10 and an open one starts at v=20
# ([LSIG.3.6]):
#
#   `gap hold` -> 600 + 20 x (t-60)   growing with every tick
#   `gap zero` -> 600                 flat
assert Meter entity_id=m v=10.0
assert MeterZ entity_id=m v=10.0
pump
advance 60000000000
assert Meter entity_id=m v=20.0
assert MeterZ entity_id=m v=20.0
pump
advance 60000000000
assert Tick n=1
pump
advance 60000000000
assert Tick n=2
pump
